comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-23T06:34:13.763Z","harness:codex","Live Release Reliability39897809658 on October23 still reports new partition families at zero completed attempts and insufficient_completed_attempts, alongside retained historical native family failure rates. Latest required main CI39894565527 passed. Keep warm-up/lineage accounting distinct from product validation and preserve original failures; this read-envelope delivery does not change reliability policy or its population."
